      "statement": "import_external_issue creates the Kanban task deterministically: it resolves the board, derives the task id and 'issue:' dedup key, infers priority/category unless overridden, builds a '[Triage] [<Type>] [<key>] <title>' title, and passes an explicit task_id plus external_issue/dedup_key metadata through TaskCreate to the dashboard create-task endpoint; a require_ai_request guard rejects issues lacking the human AI-investigation label unless forced.",
